```
Enter a paragraph of text: However, there are two fundamental ways in which our work differs from this body of work. All these papers assume (a) linear ranking functions, and (b) the functions themselves are 'white boxes', i.e., the weights are known. In contrast, our approach...
Technical percentage: 34.21%
```

